{"id":"cea02ee793bb0f7b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-ktrivial-real.md","title":"K 平凡实数","display":"df-ktrivial-real — K 平凡实数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-ktrivial-real","aliases":["43-df-ktrivial-real"],"display":"df-ktrivial-real — K 平凡实数","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.15.1.1, printed p.407 / PDF p.427","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-ktrivial-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-ktrivial-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ktrivial-real — K 平凡实数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.15.1.1, printed p.407 / PDF p.427"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>，二进制展开允许二进有理数的两个展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\iff\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\iff\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二进有理数的两个展开均最终常值，因此均可计算且 K 平凡；存在展开定义在端点无歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]，二进制展开允许二进有理数的两个展开。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}(\\alpha)\\iff\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\alpha=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\land\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)].","display":true}],"bytes":1039,"backlinks":[{"id":"614b71d8502e7bb4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$ 与 $\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]、[[43-df-dce-real]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial-real]] — K 平凡实数"},{"id":"627d2ee8d88635b3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in[0,1]$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$、$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\operatorname{ComputableReal}$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\operatorname{ComputableSet}$、$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$、$\\#_2$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]、[[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-computable-real]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-prefixfree]]、[[43-df-effective-coding]]。"},{"id":"e672124c87f9c3e9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in[0,1]$ 且 $\\alpha+\\beta\\le1$；$\\mathrm{KTrivialReal}$ 见 [[43-df-ktrivial-real]]。"}],"outgoing":["ccd45302acc926e6"]}